l insufficiency may be observed in the context of severe-early onset variants.\nsynonym: \"NR5A1-related sex development disorder\" EXACT [https://www.clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40073/] {OMO:0002001=\"https://w3id.org/information-resource-registry/clingen\"}\nis_a: MONDO:0005039 {source=\"PMID:28033660\", source=\"https://www.clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40073/\"} ! reproductive system disorder\nintersection_of: MONDO:0005039 ! reproductive system disorder\nintersection_of: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/7983 ! NR5A1\nrelationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/7983 {source=\"PMID:28033660\"} ! NR5A1\nproperty_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7638-4659\nproperty_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9863\" xsd:anyURI\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
